    <tr><td>LLP Form 8</td><td>Every LLP</td><td>Accounts audited if turnover exceeds Rs. 40 lakh or contribution exceeds Rs. 25 lakh (Rule 24(8))</td><td>Two designated partners (DSC); certified by practising CA, CS or CMA</td></tr>
